<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine unemployment rises to 242,090.</title>
<headline>Ukraine unemployment rises to 242,090.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Ukraine rose to 242,090 (about 0.9 percent of the workforce) at the end of August from 229,300 in July, the Statistics Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINIAN UNEMPLOYMENT   AUG 96    JULY 96   AUG 95</p>
<p> number of unemployed	  242,090   229,300   94,573</p>
<p> percentage of workforce     0.9	 0.8	 0.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Official Ukrainian information tends to understate unemployment levels.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
